### 问题分析

1. **包围盒计算不准确**：
   - 你在计算物体的包围盒时，使用了渲染器的`bounds`，这可能没有考虑到物体的旋转或其他变换。
   - 建议使用`Renderer.bounds`结合`Transform`的变换矩阵来获取更准确的包围盒。

2. **边界点设置问题**：
   - 你设置了八个边界点，每个点的包围盒`size`都设置为`0.1f`，这可能太小，无法准确反映物体的实际大小。
   - 应该根据物体的实际大小来设置包围盒的`size`，或者直接使用物体的包围盒来进行测试。

3. **相机后退逻辑**：
   - 相机每次后退固定的步长`5f`，这可能导致 overshoot 或者需要过多的迭代。
   - 可以考虑计算一个更合适的步长，或者直接计算出相机需要后退的总距离。

4. **视锥体平面计算**：
   - 你使用`GeometryUtility.CalculateFrustumPlanes(camera)`来获取视锥体的平面，这本身是正确的。
   - 但是，确保相机的投影模式（透视或正交）和相关参数（如 fov、near/far � flies）设置正确。

### 解决方案

#### 1. 准确计算物体的包围盒

使用`Renderer.bounds`结合`Transform`的变换矩阵来获取物体的世界包围盒：

```csharp
foreach (Renderer renderer in renderers)
{
    if (renderer == null)
        continue;

    Bounds bounds = renderer.bounds;
    bounds = renderer.transform.TransformBounds(bounds);

    if (bounds.min.x < minX)
        minX = bounds.min.x;
    if (bounds.min.z < minZ)
        minZ = bounds.min.z;
    if (bounds.min.y < minY)
        minY = bounds.min.y;

    if (bounds.max.x > maxX)
        maxX = bounds.max.x;
    if (bounds.max.z > maxZ)
        maxZ = bounds.max.z;
    if (bounds.max.y > maxY)
        maxY = bounds.max.y;
}
```

#### 2. 设置正确的边界点

根据计算出的`minX, minY, minZ, maxX, maxY, maxZ`来设置边界点，并使用这些点的实际包围盒进行测试：

```csharp
Bounds bounds1 = new Bounds(new Vector3(minX, minY, minZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f));
Bounds bounds2 = new Bounds(new Vector3(maxX, minY, minZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f));
Bounds bounds3 = new Bounds(new Vector3(maxX, minY, maxZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f));
Bounds bounds4 = new Bounds(new Vector3(minX, minY, maxZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f));
Bounds bounds5 = new Bounds(new Vector3(minX, maxY, minZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f));
Bounds bounds6 = new Bounds(new Vector3(maxX, maxY, minZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f));
Bounds bounds7 = new Bounds(new Vector3(maxX, maxY, maxZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f));
Bounds bounds8 = new Bounds(new Vector3(minX, maxY, maxZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f));
```

#### 3. 改进相机后退逻辑

计算相机需要后退的总距离，而不是每次移动固定步长：

```csharp
Vector3 cameraForward = camera.transform.forward.normalized;
Vector3 lookAtPoint = centerPos;
float distance = 0f;

// 计算所有边界点到相机的视锥体的距离
float[] distances = new float[8];
distances[0] = CalculateDistanceToFrustum(camera, bounds1);
distances[1] = CalculateDistanceToFrustum(camera, bounds2);
// ... 其他边界点

float maxDistance = Mathf.Max(distances);

while (maxDistance > 0f)
{
    camera.transform.position += cameraForward * maxDistance;
    planes = GeometryUtility.CalculateFrustumPlanes(camera);
    // 重新计算 distances
    // ...
    maxDistance = Mathf.Max(distances);
}
```

其中，`CalculateDistanceToFrustum`是一个自定义函数，用于计算某个包围盒到相机视锥体的距离。

#### 4. 调试和优化

- 在调试时，绘制相机的视锥体和物体的包围盒，确保它们的位置和方向正确。
- 可以使用`Debug.DrawFrustum`来绘制相机的视锥体。
- 确保相机的`Field of View`（FOV）和`Projection`模式（透视或正交）设置正确。

### 代码优化示例

```csharp
IEnumerator CalculateMapViewCameraFinalPosition(GameObject car, Camera camera)
{
    yield return new WaitForEndOfFrame();
    yield return new WaitForEndOfFrame();

    List<Renderer> renderers = new List<Renderer>();
    foreach (var root in Roots)
    {
        renderers.AddRange(GetRenderesInMapViewLayer(root.transform, camera));
    }

    float minX = float.MaxValue;
    float minZ = float.MaxValue;
    float minY = float.MaxValue;
    float maxX = float.MinValue;
    float maxZ = float.MinValue;
    float maxY = float.MinValue;

    foreach (Renderer renderer in renderers)
    {
        if (renderer == null)
            continue;

        Bounds bounds = renderer.bounds;
        bounds = renderer.transform.TransformBounds(bounds);

        if (bounds.min.x < minX)
            minX = bounds.min.x;
        if (bounds.min.z < minZ)
            minZ = bounds.min.z;
        if (bounds.min.y < minY)
            minY = bounds.min.y;

        if (bounds.max.x > maxX)
            maxX = bounds.max.x;
        if (bounds.max.z > maxZ)
            maxZ = bounds.max.z;
        if (bounds.max.y > maxY)
            maxY = bounds.max.y;
    }

    Vector3 centerPos = new Vector3((minX + maxX) / 2f, (minY + maxY) / 2f, (minZ + maxZ) / 2f);
    camera.transform.position = centerPos;

    // 计算相机方向
    Vector3 tempVec = Quaternion.AngleAxis(ParkingCompleteCameraRotation + 90, Vector3.up) * car.transform.forward;
    Vector3 tempCross = Vector3.Cross(Vector3.up, tempVec);
    Vector3 finalForward = Quaternion.AngleAxis(180 - ParkingCompleteCameraRotation, tempCross) * tempVec;
    camera.transform.forward = finalForward.normalized;

    // 定义边界点的包围盒
    Bounds[] boundsArray = new Bounds[8]
    {
        new Bounds(new Vector3(minX, minY, minZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f)),
        new Bounds(new Vector3(maxX, minY, minZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f)),
        new Bounds(new Vector3(maxX, minY, maxZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f)),
        new Bounds(new Vector3(minX, minY, maxZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f)),
        new Bounds(new Vector3(minX, maxY, minZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f)),
        new Bounds(new Vector3(maxX, maxY, minZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f)),
        new Bounds(new Vector3(maxX, maxY, maxZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f)),
        new Bounds(new Vector3(minX, maxY, maxZ), new Vector3(0.1f, 0.1f, 0.1f)),
    };

    Plane[] planes = GeometryUtility.CalculateFrustumPlanes(camera);

    bool inside = true;
    foreach (Bounds bound in boundsArray)
    {
        if (!GeometryUtility.TestPlanesAABB(planes, bound))
        {
            inside = false;
            break;
        }
    }

    while (!inside)
    {
        // 计算所有边界点到相机的视锥体的距离
        float[] distances = new float[8];
        for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++)
        {
            distances[i] = CalculateDistanceToFrustum(camera, boundsArray[i]);
        }

        float maxDistance = Mathf.Max(distances);

        if (maxDistance <= 0f)
            break;

        camera.transform.position += camera.transform.forward * maxDistance;

        planes = GeometryUtility.CalculateFrustumPlanes(camera);

        inside = true;
        foreach (Bounds bound in boundsArray)
        {
            if (!GeometryUtility.TestPlanesAABB(planes, bound))
            {
                inside = false;
                break;
            }
        }
    }
}

float CalculateDistanceToFrustum(Camera camera, Bounds bound)
{
    Plane[] planes = GeometryUtility.CalculateFrustumPlanes(camera);
    float distance = 0f;

    foreach (Plane plane in planes)
    {
        float dist = plane.GetDistanceToPoint(bound.center);
        if (dist < 0f)
        {
            // 边界盒在平面的后面，需要后退
            distance = Mathf.Max(distance, -dist);
        }
    }

    return distance;
}
```

