### **使用示例**
```java
Bitmap bitmap1 = BitmapFactory.decodeResource(getResources(), R.drawable.image1);
Bitmap bitmap2 = BitmapFactory.decodeResource(getResources(), R.drawable.image2);

BitmapBlender blender = new BitmapBlender(bitmap1.getWidth(), bitmap1.getHeight());
Bitmap resultBitmap = blender.blendBitmaps(bitmap1, bitmap2);

// 显示或保存 resultBitmap
imageView.setImageBitmap(resultBitmap);
```

